#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:5
#: 805879a671cc45449dec63f7d3ede11c
msgid "FLIR Vue Pro"
msgstr "FLIR Vue Pro"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:7
#: ef4c90d2443e4842961e997985466d7f
msgid ""
"The `FLIR Vue Pro <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__ infrared "
"camera supports MAVLink which allows the camera to add position and attitude"
" information to each image stored on its internal SD card"
msgstr ""
"`FLIR Vue Pro <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__ "
"红外相机支持MAVLink，允许相机将位置和姿态信息添加到存储在其内置SD卡上的每张图像中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:11
#: 7a5c591b82a44dc6af23dca07bba58d2
msgid ""
"The Flir Vue Pro MAVLink interface appears to be broken in the latest "
"firmware from FLIR (ver 3.3.2) meaning pictures taken will not include EXIF "
"data of the vehicle's position and attitude"
msgstr ""
"FLIR Vue Pro的MAVLink接口在FLIR最新固件（版本3.3.2）中似乎已损坏，拍摄的图片将不包含飞行器位置和姿态的EXIF数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:16
#: 2a3d5ba8154843ef8399db5f475bbfcc
msgid "*image courtesy of flir.com*"
msgstr "*图片来源：flir.com*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:18
#: 177a4f4ba5c744d9a551d60c6445204e
msgid ""
"Some of these instructions are based on information from the `FLIR Vue Pro "
"User Guide <https://www.flir.com/globalassets/imported-"
"assets/document/436-0013-10-vue-pro-and-r-user-guide.pdf>`__ and "
"`Tuffwing.com "
"<http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"部分说明基于 `FLIR Vue Pro用户指南 <https://www.flir.com/globalassets/imported-"
"assets/document/436-0013-10-vue-pro-and-r-user-guide.pdf>`__ 和 `Tuffwing.com"
" <http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__"
" 的信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:21
#: 2d2169e08b04450fad907927445414f2
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:23
#: 28ff4edaca5546ed96aa77e5865f68e3
msgid ""
"Flir Vue Pro is available directly from `flir.com "
"<https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Flir Vue Pro可直接从 `flir.com <https://www.flir.com/products/vue-pro/>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:24
#: deb1f7a202b94c349e1c679edce0fd36
msgid ""
"`Flir Cable Accessory Cable <https://www.flir.com/products/4142156_cable-"
"accessory-port/>`__ (for Pixhawk1 using DF13 connectors) or `Tuffwing.com's "
"Flir Vue Pro trigger and geotag cable "
"<http://www.tuffwing.com/store/store.html#flir_vue_cable>`__ (for most other"
" autopilots using JST connectors)"
msgstr ""
"`Flir配件线缆 <https://www.flir.com/products/4142156_cable-accessory-port/>`__ "
"（适用于使用DF13连接器的Pixhawk1）或 `Tuffwing.com的Flir Vue Pro触发和地理标记线缆 "
"<http://www.tuffwing.com/store/store.html#flir_vue_cable>`__ "
"（适用于大多数使用JST连接器的其他飞控）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:27
#: d460b769a0064394a78dc4b003826bce
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:33
#: bcfd766570db4df1b0bc38e357c80307
msgid ""
"Plug one end of the accessory cable into the camera's 7-pin DF13 connector "
"(found next to the micro USB port) and then the other 6-pin connector to one"
" of the autopilot's telemetry ports.  In this example Telem2 is used."
msgstr ""
"将配件线缆一端插入相机的7针DF13连接器（位于micro USB端口旁），另一端6针连接器插入飞控的一个数传端口。本示例使用Telem2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:35
#: 6749d718789f4dac87d4d6969f9dec4a
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters on the autopilot (assuming Telem2/Serial2 is "
"used):"
msgstr "在飞控上设置以下参数（假设使用Telem2/Serial2）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:37
#: 043c0c5e5365489db13b872087c02d13
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink 1)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1（MAVLink 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:38
#: 3f58c01c0122401290edfcfe16765f17
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 57 (57200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 57（57200波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:39
#: 19834bc78c0d4d6692559398f1d6c999
msgid ""
":ref:`MAV3_POSITION <MAV3_POSITION>` = 5 to send the vehicle's position to "
"the camera at 5hz"
msgstr ":ref:`MAV3_POSITION <MAV3_POSITION>` = 5，以5Hz向相机发送飞行器位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:41
#: 9a5721035fd145bf8be11fc2e4932aac
msgid ""
"To allow triggering the taking of pictures during a mission or from a "
"transmitter's auxiliary switch connect the \"P3\" 3-pin servo connector to "
"the one of the autopilot's servo outputs.  In this example AUX OUT 1 (aka "
"SERVO9) is used.  Then set the following parameters (Assuming the Camera1 "
"instance):"
msgstr ""
"要允许在任务执行期间或通过发射机辅助开关触发拍照，将「P3」3针舵机连接器连接到飞控的某个舵机输出。本示例使用AUX OUT "
"1（即SERVO9）。然后设置以下参数（假设使用Camera1实例）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:44
#: ee9a41d078ff45c0ada6394be31fe1d2
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 1 (Servo)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 1（舵机）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:45
#: 067d7b9f57a846149f13f3a412670adc
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>` = 1900"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>` = 1900"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:46
#: 39bb051037ed4cba9cdcfa506f7565bd
msgid ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = 10 (Camera Trigger)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = 10（相机触发）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:47
#: 25c16d1512d645ffa07c889a48cd28a4
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 9 (Camera Trigger) to enable triggering "
"from transmitter switch 8"
msgstr ":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 9（相机触发），通过发射机开关8触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:50
#: c03e253bda0e4915954e2b1ee791b71e
msgid "Configure the Phone"
msgstr "配置手机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:52
#: 5523259cd14e4bf0a466c04b591956a3
msgid ""
"`As described on Tuffwing.com "
"<http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__,"
" install the Flir UAS app on your phone (`android "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flir.vuepro&hl=en>`__ or "
"`iPhone <https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/flir-uas/id1051901140?mt=8>`__), "
"power up the camera and connect from your phone using BlueTooth.  Set the "
"following options for the Accessory Port:"
msgstr ""
"`如Tuffwing.com所述 "
"<http://www.tuffwing.com/support/Flir_Vue_Pro_Pixhawk_Installation.html>`__，在手机上安装Flir"
" UAS应用（`安卓 "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flir.vuepro&hl=en>`__ 或 "
"`iPhone <https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/flir-"
"uas/id1051901140?mt=8>`__），为相机通电并通过蓝牙连接。设置配件端口的以下选项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:54
#: 2ea5e67f04d541aa80c6433f73575cd0
msgid "Serial Protocol: MAVLink"
msgstr "串行协议：MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:55
#: 43a8e8bdde094b399fb92b3a155ac4ae
msgid "Serial Data Rate: 57600"
msgstr "串行数据速率：57600"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:56
#: e6dd85c6ba194940907be90f60d6a5d9
msgid "Channel 1 : MAVLink TX"
msgstr "通道1：MAVLink TX"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:57
#: 67335848ed4e4448a94ade0d433fc6ff
msgid "Channel 3: Record Start/Stop"
msgstr "通道3：录制开始/停止"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:60
#: d22e878fc1f34cedbe839e840bb56484
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:62
#: 4eee9455dc9b497b9265136d255bcf91
msgid ""
"Power up the camera and autopilot in a location where the vehicle can get a "
"GPS lock."
msgstr "在飞行器能获取GPS锁定的位置，为相机和飞控通电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:63
#: 8ccd4e62c36c48e4bdfee94f1dde16f3
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (like Mission Planner) and check that the "
"vehicle appears on the map"
msgstr "用地面站（如Mission Planner）连接，并确认飞行器出现在地图上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:64
#: c879617eed234daca64a25e1ce3bb007
msgid ""
"If the serial connection between the autopilot and camera is working then "
"shortly after the camera is powered on, it will begin sending heartbeats to "
"the autopilot and ground station which, if using the Mission Planner, will "
"make it appear as \"CAMERA\" in the top-right drop-down.  Selecting the "
"CAMERA will not work though because the camera does not respond to requests "
"for parameters"
msgstr ""
"若飞控与相机之间的串行连接正常，相机通电后不久即会向飞控和地面站发送心跳包，如果使用Mission "
"Planner，它将在右上角下拉菜单中显示为「CAMERA」。选择CAMERA不会起作用，因为相机不响应参数请求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:69
#: 0695be48a14a4b9b999f96a7c3ba8cc5
msgid ""
"Trigger taking a picture using the transmitter's auxiliary switch or by "
"right-mouse-button-clicking on the map and selecting \"Trigger Camera NOW\"."
"  The camera should beep"
msgstr "通过发射机辅助开关或在地图上点击鼠标右键并选择「立即触发相机」来拍照。相机应发出蜂鸣声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:70
#: a0fe48f83998463a815845628a5124d4
msgid ""
"Connect the camera to your computer using a USB cable (or remove the "
"camera's SD card) and check that an image has been captured"
msgstr "用USB线缆将相机连接到电脑（或取出相机SD卡），检查是否已拍摄图像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flir-vue-pro.rst:71
#: 7d7112f5b1ce4a398e0b672dabfc4087
msgid ""
"Check the file properties to ensure the latitude, longitude and altitude "
"have been recorded with the image"
msgstr "检查文件属性，确认图像已记录纬度、经度和高度"
